  description: 'You can reveal this card in your hand; your opponent randomly chooses
    1 card from your entire hand, then you discard the chosen card. Then, if the
    discarded card was not "Danger! Ogopogo!", Special Summon 1 "Danger! Ogopogo!"
    from your hand, and if you do, draw 1 card. If this card is discarded: You can
    send 1 "Danger!" card from your Deck to the GY, except "Danger! Ogopogo!". You
    can only use this effect of "Danger! Ogopogo!" once per turn.'
